{"id":"095c8f460134f37c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/303_无类型_λ-演算.md","title":"303 无类型 λ-演算","display":"303_无类型_λ-演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"303-无类型-λ-演算\">303 无类型 λ-演算</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与变量\">1. 原始符号与变量</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_\\lambda(X)=x_m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_\\lambda(X)=x_m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始项构造子只有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\qquad \\operatorname{app},\\qquad \\operatorname{lam}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var},\\qquad \\operatorname{app},\\qquad \\operatorname{lam}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MN\">\\(MN\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda x.M\">\\(\\lambda x.M\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)\">\\(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)\\)</span>。应用左结合只是显示约定，不是额外构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、上下文与填孔\">2. 项、上下文与填孔</h1>\n<p>定义无类型 λ 项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\Lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\Lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)\\in\\Lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一孔项上下文集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{hole}\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{hole}\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appL}(C,M)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{appL}(C,M)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{appR}(M,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{appR}(M,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C)\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义填孔函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda:\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda:\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{hole},M)=M,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{hole},M)=M,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{appL}(C,N),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M),N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{appL}(C,N),M)=\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M),N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{appR}(N,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(N,\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{appR}(N,C),M)=\\operatorname{app}(N,\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C),M)=\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{lamC}(x,C),M)=\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、绑定变量与重命名\">3. 自由变量、绑定变量与重命名</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))=\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{var}(x))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(N),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{app}(M,N))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(M)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(N),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量重命名部分函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\rightharpoonup\\Lambda\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\rightharpoonup\\Lambda\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}\">\\(M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}\\)</span>，并由下列子句定义（不满足所示侧条件时无定义）：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(z)[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(z),&amp;z\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(z)[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;z=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(z),&amp;z\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}\n=\n\\operatorname{app}(M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r},N[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(M,N)[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}\n=\n\\operatorname{app}(M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r},N[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(z,M)[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{lam}(y,M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}),&amp;z=x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{lam}(z,M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}),&amp;z\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ (y\\ne z\\ \\text{或}\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(z,M)[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{lam}(y,M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}),&amp;z=x\\ \\text{且}\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{lam}(z,M[y/x]_{\\mathsf r}),&amp;z\\ne x\\ \\text{且}\\ (y\\ne z\\ \\text{或}\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一个分支把绑定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 改名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 外不自由出现，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中原有的自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 被新绑定子捕获；第二个分支保持绑定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 不变，当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=z\">\\(y=z\\)</span> 时要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 中自由出现，否则替换产生的自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 被绑定子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 捕获。两个侧条件共同保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_\\lambda\\)</span> 在凡有定义处均无捕获。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-捕获避免替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">4. 捕获避免替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义捕获避免替换</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_\\lambda:\\Lambda\\times\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\times\\Lambda\\to\\Lambda\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[x:=N]\">\\(M[x:=N]\\)</span>，并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{var}(y)[x:=N]=\n\\begin{cases}\nN,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(P,Q)[x:=N]\n=\n\\operatorname{app}(P[x:=N],Q[x:=N]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{app}(P,Q)[x:=N]\n=\n\\operatorname{app}(P[x:=N],Q[x:=N]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(x,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(x,P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(x,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(x,P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(y,P[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]=\\operatorname{lam}(y,P[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N)\">\\(y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_\\lambda\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_\\lambda\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(N)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]\n=\n\\operatorname{lam}(z,(P[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=N]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lam}(y,P)[x:=N]\n=\n\\operatorname{lam}(z,(P[y:=\\operatorname{var}(z)])[x:=N]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda\\times\\Lambda\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^\\lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda\\times\\Lambda\\)</span> 为所有满足下列条件的二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交集。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,N)\\in E\">\\((M,N)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,Q)\\in E\">\\((P,Q)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{app}(M,P),\\operatorname{app}(N,Q))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{app}(M,P),\\operatorname{app}(N,Q))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,N)\\in E\">\\((M,N)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),\\operatorname{lam}(x,N))\\in E\">\\((\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),\\operatorname{lam}(x,N))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),\\operatorname{lam}(y,M[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),\\operatorname{lam}(y,M[x:=\\operatorname{var}(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-等式公式与原始公理\">5. 等式公式与原始公理</h1>\n<p>项等式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda=\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda=\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始无类型 λ-演算的公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq M:M\\in\\Lambda\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{refl}}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq M:M\\in\\Lambda\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda,\\ M\\equiv_\\alpha^\\lambda N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\alpha}\n=\n\\{M\\doteq N:M,N\\in\\Lambda,\\ M\\equiv_\\alpha^\\lambda N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>传递式等式规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N,N\\doteq P),M\\doteq P):M,N,P\\in\\Lambda\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N,N\\doteq P),M\\doteq P):M,N,P\\in\\Lambda\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对称式等式规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),N\\doteq M):M,N\\in\\Lambda\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),N\\doteq M):M,N\\in\\Lambda\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上下文同余规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M)\\doteq\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{((M\\doteq N),\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,M)\\doteq\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda(C,N)):\nC\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象与可导关系\">7. 证明对象与可导关系</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda\\)</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda0\">\\(\\lambda0\\)</span>-证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda\\)</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;n\">\\(i&lt;n\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(E_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\lambda0}\">\\(((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\lambda0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\lambda0}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\lambda0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1})\">\\(\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1})\\)</span> 是上述从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda0\">\\(\\lambda0\\)</span>-证明且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{n-1}=E\">\\(E_{n-1}=E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\lambda0}E\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\lambda0}E\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,E)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda0}\\)</span> 为所有上述有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda0\">\\(\\lambda0\\)</span>-证明序列的集合。无前提原子判断集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标区分条款\">8. 目标区分条款</h1>\n<p>为把本系统同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\beta\">\\(\\lambda\\beta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\eta\">\\(\\lambda\\eta\\)</span> 等式系统分开，先定义两个可检查的候选等式族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BetaEq}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),N)\\doteq M[x:=N]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{BetaEq}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{app}(\\operatorname{lam}(x,M),N)\\doteq M[x:=N]:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda,\\ M,N\\in\\Lambda\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EtaEq}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{app}(M,\\operatorname{var}(x)))\\doteq M:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda,\\ M\\in\\Lambda,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EtaEq}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{lam}(x,\\operatorname{app}(M,\\operatorname{var}(x)))\\doteq M:\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda,\\ M\\in\\Lambda,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无类型原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-演算的目标差异条件定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0}):\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\\cap\\mathsf{BetaEq}_{\\lambda0}=\\varnothing\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\\cap\\mathsf{EtaEq}_{\\lambda0}=\\varnothing\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda0}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0}):\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\\cap\\mathsf{BetaEq}_{\\lambda0}=\\varnothing\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0}\\cap\\mathsf{EtaEq}_{\\lambda0}=\\varnothing\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 等式和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 外延式都不是公理行；若它们可出现，只能由前述有限等式证明关系实际推出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_\\lambda\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda,\n\\Lambda,\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_\\lambda,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^\\lambda,\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{BetaEq}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{EtaEq}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda0},\n\\vdash_{\\lambda0}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal U_\\lambda\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda,\n\\Lambda,\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{plug}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{FV}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{BV}_\\lambda,\n\\operatorname{Sub}_\\lambda,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^\\lambda,\n\\mathsf{EqFrm}_\\lambda,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}^{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{sym}}^{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ctx}}^{\\lambda0},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Der}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{AxJdg}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{BetaEq}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{EtaEq}_{\\lambda0},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\lambda0},\n\\vdash_{\\lambda0}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含无类型 λ 项、捕获避免替换、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价、构造同余、原子判断集合和有限等式证明关系；不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 约化、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 外延、公理化类型、解释结构或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"303-无类型-λ-演算","text":"303 无类型 λ-演算","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号与变量","text":"1. 原始符号与变量","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、上下文与填孔","text":"2. 项、上下文与填孔","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、绑定变量与重命名","text":"3. 自由变量、绑定变量与重命名","level":1},{"id":"4.-捕获避免替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"4. 捕获避免替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式公式与原始公理","text":"5. 等式公式与原始公理","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象与可导关系","text":"7. 证明对象与可导关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标区分条款","text":"8. 目标区分条款","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fresh}_\\lambda(X)=x_m","display":true},{"tex":"m=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:x_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\qquad \\operatorname{app},\\qquad \\operatorname{lam}.","display":true},{"tex":"MN","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda x.M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lam}(x,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(M,N)\\in\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}